  short='320 foundry workers, 200 personal samples (NIOSH 7300, ICP-OES): Fe, Mn, Pb, Cd, Cu often above OELs; Pb/Cd/Cr/Ni inversely related to FEV1/FVC; As ELCR 4.1e-4',
